    <string name="menu_about">About</string>
    <string name="how_body">1. Tap «Choose a file», or share a photo, video, audio file or PDF to Sahb from any app.\n2. A ring of the formats that file supports appears. Tap one.\n3. Tap the centre of the ring to switch between conversion and tools (compress, resize, crop, trim, mute, strip metadata, watermark, PDF pages, ZIP).\n4. Check the summary, then start. The new file is saved in the «Sahb» folder; your original is not changed.</string>
    <string name="about_body">Sahb %1$s\nDeveloped by Taha Mustafa Al-Nifati.\n\nConversions run on your phone. The app has no internet permission, so files are not uploaded, and it collects no data.</string>
